    {
        "content": "<p>Grind can process divisibility constraints specifically for linear integer arithmetic (and things that behave like linear integers through the <code>ToInt</code> typeclass) built-in, for everything else you have to specify e matching annotations yourself</p>",
        "id": 593096241,
        "sender_full_name": "Henrik Böving",
        "timestamp": 1778012159
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"395550\">Henrik Böving</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/113488-general/topic/Divisibility.20in.20grind/near/593096241\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Grind can process divisibility constraints specifically for linear integer arithmetic (and things that behave like linear integers through the <code>ToInt</code> typeclass) built-in, for everything else you have to specify e matching annotations yourself</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>By e matching annotations, you mean something like this?</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">attribute</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">grind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;=</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">dvd_rfl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">dvd_trans</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">dvd_add</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">dvd_sub</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mul_dvd_mul</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">dvd_mul_of_dvd_left</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">dvd_mul_of_dvd_right</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">dvd_pow_self</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">pow_dvd_pow_of_dvd</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">attribute</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">grind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">dvd_add_left</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">dvd_add_right</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">dvd_sub_left</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">dvd_sub_right</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
